{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13316","headline":"李二侍御丹阳东去新亭 · 皇甫冉","name":"李二侍御丹阳东去新亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"姑苏东望海陵间，几度裁书信未还。\n长在府中持白简，岂知天畔有青山。\n人归极浦寒流广，雁下平芜秋野闲。\n旧日新亭更携手，他乡风景亦相关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}